==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|sh}} {{term|tragoedia|lang=la}}, from the {{etyl|grc|sh}} {{term|τραγῳδία||epic play, tragedy|lang=grc}}, from {{term|τράγος||male goat|lang=grc}} + {{term|ᾠδή||song|lang=grc}}, a reference to the goat-satyrs of the theatrical plays of the [[Dorians]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/trǎɡeːdija/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|тра|ге|ди|ја|lang=sh}}

